Only flaw I see is no source of magic resistance. Without that, you're 
vulnerable to the touch of death. Since you've geno'd all types of 
liches, you may be reasonably safe until you wake Rodney; at that point, 
MR is virtually necessary.

Also, your helmet is virtually useless (except against falling rocks and 
mind flayers). At the very least, I'd enchant it up and if possible 
grease it. And speed boots are certainly worth a wish (although if my 
count is right, you're down to 1:1, aren't you? May want to save it).
